#: pts-metabox.php:45
msgid "Pub. to Schedule"
msgstr "Inplannen"

#: pts-metabox.php:140 pts-metabox.php:146 publish-to-schedule-admin.php:290
#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:312
msgid "Your WordPress timezone settings might be incorrect!"
msgstr "Je Wordpress tijdzone is waarschijnlijk niet goed ingesteld!"

#: pts-metabox.php:142
msgid "See details"
msgstr "Bekijk details"

#: pts-metabox.php:148
msgid "Please tell the blog admin!"
msgstr "Meldt dit aan de beheerder!"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:216
msgid "Post already scheduled for a future date!"
msgstr "Bericht is al ingepland in de toekomst!"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:218
msgid "In this case, the plugin will do nothing!"
msgstr "Deze plugin zal nu niks aanpassen!"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:333
msgid "post at "
msgstr "plaatsen op "

#: publish-to-schedule.php:335
msgid "Edit post"
msgstr "Bericht bewerken"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:340 publish-to-schedule.php:384
msgid "of"
msgstr "op"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:386
msgid "available day!"
msgstr "Beschikbare dag!"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:397
msgid "Too late to publish"
msgstr "Te laat om te publiceren"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:472
msgid ""
"To publish in a different date and bypass the plugin, first choose the "
"schedule date from the WordPress controls above and then click the Schedule "
"button!"
msgstr ""
"Wil je dit bericht nu plaatsen, selecteer dan een datum via de standaard "
"Wordpress ‘inplannen’ optie. En klik dan op “Inplannen”."

#: publish-to-schedule.php:480
msgid "Will be schedule to"
msgstr "Zal worden geplaatst op"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:482
msgid "at"
msgstr "om"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:513
msgid "Could not find a suitable date to this post!"
msgstr "Er kan geen beschikbare datum worden gevonden voor dit bericht!"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:514
msgid "No changes will be made to this post date!"
msgstr "Dit bericht zal niet worden aangepast!"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:515
msgid "Something is wrong!"
msgstr "Er is iets misgegaan!"

#: publish-to-schedule.php:516
msgid "Please contact the plugin developer!"
msgstr "Neem contact op met de plugin ontwikkelaar!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:129
msgid "You must check \"Yes\" for at least 1 day of week! "
msgstr "Je moet minstens bij een 1 dag “Ja” neerzetten!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:132
msgid "Options saved!"
msgstr "Instellingen opgeslagen!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:148
msgid "Plugin version"
msgstr "Plugin versie"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:151
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Instellingen"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:158
msgid ""
"I am working on this plugin for 10+ years. <br />Please make a donation!<br /"
">It is a hell of an incentive for me!"
msgstr ""

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:172
msgid "Believe me... even <strong>$"
msgstr ""

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:192
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Which days of the week posts are allowed to be auto-scheduled? <br>(The "
"schedule happens only when you click the \"Pub. to Schedule\" button!)"
msgstr "Welke dagen mogen gebruikt worden, voor het plaatsen van berichten?"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:194
msgid "Put 0 in a day when you do not want posts to be scheduled!"
msgstr ""
"Zet een 0 achter de dag, als je op deze dag geen berichten ingepland wil "
"hebben."

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:197
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Example: if you put 0 on Sunday, this plugin will never schedule a post to "
"be published on Sundays. <br> But still, if you want to schedule an article "
"to be published on a Sunday, just schedule it using the standard schedule "
"button of WordPress and it will be published on the date you choose, "
"ignoring all options below!<br>"
msgstr ""
"Voorbeeld: Als je een 0 plaats achter zondag, zullen er nooit berichten op "
"deze dag ingepland worden. Mocht je dat alsnog willen, gebruik dan de "
"Wordpress instellingen om het bericht in te plannen."

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:199
msgid "For each day, set how many posts will be scheduled!"
msgstr "Stel in hoeveel berichten er elke dag ingepland mogen worden."

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:257
msgid ""
"Specify the time interval in which you want to have your posts scheduled!"
msgstr "Tussen welke tijden moeten de berichten ingepland worden?"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:260
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Example: posts will only be scheduled to be published in this time interval."
"<br> But still, if you use the WordPress schedule button, you can schedule "
"for any time you want!"
msgstr ""
"Voorbeeld: Stel dit in op 09:00 en 17:00 en de berichten zullen automatisch "
"worden ingepland tussen negen en vijf."

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:266
msgid "Start Time"
msgstr "Begintijd"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:267
msgid " (defaults to 00:00)"
msgstr "(standaard 00:00)"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:271
msgid "End Time"
msgstr "Eindtijd"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:272
msgid " (defaults to 23:59)"
msgstr "(standaard 23:59)"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:292
#, fuzzy
msgid "The date and time we detected: "
msgstr "Wordpress zegt dat het zo laat is: "

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:308
msgid "Your timezone configuration and server time seems to be OK!"
msgstr "De tijdzone en systeemtijd lijkt in orde te zijn!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:314
msgid "According to your web server"
msgstr "Volgens je webserver"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:316
msgid "the GMT time is: "
msgstr "de GMT tijd is: "

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:318
msgid "The timezone configured in your"
msgstr "De tijdzone die is ingesteld in je"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:318
msgid "WordPress settings"
msgstr "Wordpress instellingen"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:318
msgid "is"
msgstr "is"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:320
#, fuzzy
msgid "so your server thinks your local time is: "
msgstr "dus de server denkt heeft de volgende lokale tijd: "

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:321
#, fuzzy
msgid "but this is different from the time on your machine now!"
msgstr "maar dat is ongelijk aan de tijd van je computer!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:323
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the difference is not too big (less than 2h or 3h) you probably will not "
"have side effects and the plugin should work fine!"
msgstr ""
"Als het verschil niet zo groot (minder dan 2 uur) is, zou deze plugin gewoon "
"zijn werk kunnen doen, maar er zouden foutjes kunnen optreden."

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:325
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Otherwise, with big time differences, you can have issues with the real time "
"that each post will be scheduled!"
msgstr ""
"Anders, met grote verschillen, kunnen er problemen optreden met het "
"inplannen van berichten!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:327
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sometimes you have to set a different timezone to compensate daylight saving "
"time or a misconfigured server time! "
msgstr ""
"Soms moet je een andere tijdzone selecteren om de zomertijd (of een foute "
"server tijd) te compenseren!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:330
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you can, change the timezone to correct this, refresh this page and this "
"message will not be shown anymore!"
msgstr ""
"Als je dit kan, moet je de tijdzone goed zetten en deze pagina verversen!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:351
msgid ""
"How much information you want to see near the \"Publish\" button (on post "
"edit screen)?"
msgstr ""
"Hoeveel informatie wil je bij de “publiceer”-knop bij het plaatsen van een "
"bericht?"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:357
msgid " Show all information available!"
msgstr "Laat alle informatie zien!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:359
msgid " I want to see how this plugin works!"
msgstr "Ik wil zien hoe deze plugin zijn werk doet!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:361
#, fuzzy
msgid " (Might be a lot of text! Good for debugging purposes or enthusiasts!)"
msgstr ""
"(Het zou kunnen dat er nogal veel tekst verschijnt. Voor debugger en "
"nieuwsgierige mensen)"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:370
msgid " Just do the magic!"
msgstr " Niks laten zien, gewoon werken!"

#: publish-to-schedule-admin.php:372
msgid " Only show the calculated \"auto schedule date\" for the post!"
msgstr " Laat alleen de eerst beschikbare “publicatiedatum” zien."

